Subject: [PATCH] Move updated root-level files into src/ and remove duplicates

The root-level App.tsx, Hero.tsx, Navbar.tsx, ScheduleSection.tsx,
danceData.ts, and types.ts contained the latest updates but the app
builds from src/. Move their content into the correct src/ locations
(replacing the outdated copies) and delete the now-redundant root
files. Verified with npm run build.
